      "content": "1. Introduction to Engineering Drawing"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Engineering drawing relies on proper selection and maintenance of drawing instruments.",
        "Types of lines, dimensioning, and lettering standardise technical communication across engineering disciplines.",
        "Orthographic projection and standard symbols are foundational concepts for technical drawings."
      ],
      "id": "f805f9b"
    },
